  "decision_conditions": [
    "The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, that 3, PARK VIEW HOUSE, 29 Stanmore Hill, Stanmore, Harrow, HA7 3DT, has been in use as two self contained flats (identified as Flat 3 and Flat 3a) for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application. As such, the existing development is immune from enforcement action and is therefore lawful under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended)."
